---
import ResumeLayout from '../layouts/ResumeLayout.astro';
---
<ResumeLayout
  title="Timothy Creekmore Resume"
  description="Resume of Timothy Creekmore — junior software developer and AI/data builder."
>
  <main class="page">
    <header>
      <h1>Timothy Creekmore</h1>
      <div class="contact">
        Batesville, AR &middot;
        <a href="mailto:timcreekmore2002@gmail.com">timcreekmore2002@gmail.com</a> &middot;
        <a href="https://www.timothycreekmore.com/">timothycreekmore.com</a> &middot;
        <a href="https://github.com/Tim-Creekmore">github.com/Tim-Creekmore</a> &middot;
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/timcreekmore">linkedin.com/in/timcreekmore</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
      <p>
        Junior Software Developer and Lyon College graduate with dual degrees in Computer Science and Data Science. Experienced in software development, Python, R, SQL, machine learning, predictive modeling, OCR/data extraction, and practical AI engineering workflows. Brings a strong troubleshooting background from years as an appliance repair technician, with a focus on turning ambiguous problems into reliable systems.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills">
        <div><span class="label">Languages:</span> TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, SQL/T-SQL, C#, Java, HTML/CSS</div>
        <div><span class="label">Web:</span> React, Astro, Tailwind CSS, REST API integration</div>
        <div><span class="label">Testing &amp; delivery:</span> Vitest, Playwright, Docker, CI pipelines, Git/GitHub, database migrations, SQLite/PostgreSQL</div>
        <div><span class="label">Data / ML:</span> pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, XGBoost, regression, model evaluation</div>
        <div><span class="label">AI / Automation:</span> LLM API integration, OCR pipelines, structured extraction, validation workflows, Azure Document Intelligence</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Professional Experience</h2>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">Junior Software Developer</span> &mdash; <span class="org">Lifeplus</span></div>
          <div class="date">June 2025 &ndash; Present</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Develop and maintain software features, bug fixes, and internal tooling as part of a production software team.</li>
          <li>Collaborate with senior developers to understand requirements, debug issues, review implementation details, and ship reliable updates.</li>
          <li>Apply programming, database, automation, and data-analysis skills to improve business workflows.</li>
          <li>Bring a troubleshooting-first mindset to diagnosing defects, tracing root causes, and communicating technical findings clearly.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">Appliance Repair Technician</span> &mdash; <span class="org">Alpine Appliance, Batesville, AR</span></div>
          <div class="date">August 2017 &ndash; 2024</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Diagnosed and repaired a wide range of appliance issues across brands, models, and equipment ages.</li>
          <li>Communicated repair options and technical findings to customers clearly.</li>
          <li>Managed daily schedules, parts, component inventories, and field-service priorities.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Projects</h2>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">ProphetCMA &mdash; Real Estate Price Prediction</span></div>
          <div class="date">R, GBM, XGBoost, kNN, Random Forest</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Built an R-based ensemble modeling pipeline to automate Comparative Market Analysis for residential real estate.</li>
          <li>Compared Linear Regression, kNN, Random Forest, GBM, and XGBoost using MAE/RMSE.</li>
          <li>Achieved best result with a 15% XGBoost / 85% GBM blend: MAE 6,776 and RMSE 11,166.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">Signature Data Extraction</span></div>
          <div class="date">Python, Azure Document Intelligence, OCR</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Built a Python + Azure Document Intelligence OCR pipeline to convert scanned signature sheets into structured CSV output.</li>
          <li>Used validation logic and confidence review to separate reliable printed fields from low-confidence handwritten signatures.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">Portfolio Site</span></div>
          <div class="date">Astro, Tailwind CSS, Playwright</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Built this portfolio site with Astro and Tailwind CSS: SEO metadata, shared navigation, a CSS-drift and broken-link guard on every build, and a zero-diff Playwright visual regression suite.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <div class="row">
          <div><span class="title">Unity Game Lab</span></div>
          <div class="date">Unity URP, C#</div>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>Building a Unity URP world demo with procedural terrain, biome data assets, editor tooling, and C# placement systems.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <div class="row">
        <div><span class="title">Lyon College</span> &mdash; Batesville, AR</div>
        <div class="date">Graduated May 2025</div>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>Bachelor of Arts in Computer Science</li>
        <li>Bachelor of Science in Data Science</li>
        <li>GPA: 3.8 / 4.0 &middot; Dean's List 2022&ndash;2024</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</ResumeLayout>
